tt-win-kmd: Windows KMDF port of the Tenstorrent kernel-mode driver
====================================================================

This repository is a derivative work of tt-kmd, the Linux kernel driver for
Tenstorrent AI accelerators:

    https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-kmd
    Copyright (c) Tenstorrent Inc.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

The driver sources under src/driver and the shared ABI headers under
src/include port tt-kmd's structures, protocols and behaviour to Windows and
are therefore licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 only,
the same terms as tt-kmd. See LICENSE for the full text.

The user-mode compatibility shim (src/ttwin_compat), the test programs
(src/tests) and the tooling under tools/ and test/ are original to this
repository and are also released under GPL-2.0-only so that the whole tree is
distributed under one licence.

Upstream baseline: tt-kmd tag ttkmd-2.11.0 (commit c05f224). The unmodified
upstream licence and notice files are preserved in third_party/tt-kmd/.

This is a community port. It is not produced, endorsed or supported by
Tenstorrent Inc. "Tenstorrent", "Blackhole" and "Wormhole" are trademarks of
Tenstorrent Inc. and are used here only to identify the hardware the driver
targets.
